# Objective :
Monitor users being added to or removed from an important local group, especially Administrators , why ? 
This is important because adding a user to the Administrators group gives that user high privileges on the machine.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1-) Event ID Used : 4732 # A member was added to a security-enabled local group # , 4733 # A member was removed from a security-enabled local group#
2-) KQL Filter : (event.code:4732 OR event.code:4733) AND group.name:administrators
3-) Fields Used in the Table :
user.name.keyword => The user who performed the add or remove action
winlog.event_data.MemberSid.keyword => The member that was added or removed
group.name.keyword => Group name
event.action.keyword => Action type: add or remove
host.name.keyword => The machine where the change occurred
Count of records => Number of events
